@startuml activity-parcel-intake
title Activity Diagram(Parcel Intake And Shelving)
|Counter (Staff)|
start
:Courier delivers one parcel or a batch;
if (Batch mode?) then (yes)
  |System|
  :Validate every submitted row independently;
  :Register each valid row;
  :Collect rejected rows with index, trackingNo and reason;
  :Return ParcelBatchResult(created[], rejected[]);
  |Counter (Staff)|
  :Show successful parcels and per-row errors;
  stop
else (no)
  |Counter (Staff)|
  :Scan or type the waybill;
  |System|
  if (Duplicate waybill?) then (yes)
    :Reject and show the existing parcel;
    stop
  else (no)
    |System|
    :Recommend a storage location;
    if (A suitable location is free?) then (no)
      :Report that no location is free;
      |Counter (Staff)|
      :Choose a location manually;
      |System|
    else (yes)
      |Counter (Staff)|
      :Accept the recommended location;
      |System|
    endif
  endif
  |Counter (Staff)|
  :Shelve the parcel;
  |System|
  fork
    :Record the location and issue a pickup code;
  fork again
    :Notify the resident;
  end fork
  note right
    Both branches are internal steps of the single
    POST /parcels transaction, not two endpoints.
  end note
  :Return the single parcel result;
  |Counter (Staff)|
  stop
endif
@enduml
